English translation of the original Japanese commit message:

ci(release-npm): replace dumpbin with a Node.js PE parser

Replace dumpbin in .github/workflows/release-npm.yml with the Node.js
checker at crates/flexaudio-napi/__test__/check-pe-dependencies.mjs.
Successful Windows builds had failed inspection because dumpbin was not
on PATH, preventing artifact uploads. The checker uses Node built-ins,
reads both normal and delayed imports, and handles RVA/VA name
addresses. It rejects MSVCP, VCRUNTIME, VCOMP, DirectML, and onnxruntime
dependencies. Missing inputs, invalid PE files, and zero readable
dependencies also fail. Logs show the machine type and separate normal
and delayed DLL lists.
